Sun Aug 16 22:29:50 UTC 2026 - Atri Bhattacharya <badshah400@gmail.com>

- Update to version 1.11.0:
  * Add helpful headers (instructions to end-users) to generated
    scripts (gh#tqdm/shtab#253).
  * Add complex developer examples (gh#tqdm/shtab#253).
  * Support bash completion mid-command (gh#tqdm/shtab#248 <-
    gh#tqdm/shtab#116).
  * Bash: drop global compopt -o filenames (gh#tqdm/shtab#250 <-
    gh#tqdm/shtab#67).
  * Fix fallbacks (gh#tqdm/shtab#252).
  * Fix zsh positional ordering (gh#tqdm/shtab#251 <-
    gh#tqdm/shtab#123).
  * Misc tidying.
- Changes from version 1.10.0:
  * Add shtab.glob & shtab.cmd (e.g. glob("*.y*ml", "*.toml") &
    cmd("git branch")) (gh#tqdm/shtab#226, gh#tqdm/shtab#242 <-
    gh#tqdm/shtab#240).
  * Improve bash redirection (e.g. >&2) detection
    (gh#tqdm/shtab#211).
  * Improve tcsh (sub)command completions (gh#tqdm/shtab#247,
    gh#tqdm/shtab#241 <- gh#tqdm/shtab#236).
  * Fish: support shtab.FILE outside current directory
    (gh#tqdm/shtab#246 <- gh#tqdm/shtab#245).
  * Ensure .complete overrides choices (gh#tqdm/shtab#239).
  * Bash: fix add_argument("--optional", help=SUPPRESS)
    (gh#tqdm/shtab#211).
  * Fix bash<4 support (gh#tqdm/shtab#244 <- gh#tqdm/shtab#235,
    gh#tqdm/shtab#196).
  * Test fish<4 flags (gh#tqdm/shtab#239).
  * Tests: minimise tcsh pty forks (gh#tqdm/shtab#247).
  * Test & fix typos (gh#tqdm/shtab#100, gh#tqdm/shtab#188).
  * Misc docs, linting, testing & framework updates
    (gh#tqdm/shtab#226, gh#tqdm/shtab#249).
- Changes from previous versions 1.9.0 to 1.9.4:
  * See https://github.com/tqdm/shtab/releases

